{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2015-meet-science2-09","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2015,"subject":"chemistry","number":9,"points":2.5,"unitId":"kinetics","unitLabel":"반응 속도론","topic":"반응속도·속도상수·활성화에너지","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["kinetics"],"stem":"그림은 R →P 반응에서 일정량의 촉매 X와 촉매 Y를 사용했을\n때 280K와 300K에서 시간에 따른 R의 농도 변화를 각각 나타낸\n것이다.\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n[2.5점]\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 반응 차수는 R에 대해서 1이다.\nㄴ. 280K에서 반응 속도 상수는 촉매 X를 사용할 때가 촉매 \nY를 사용할 때보다 작다.\nㄷ. 반응의 활성화 에너지는 촉매 X를 사용할 때가 촉매 Y를 \n사용할 때보다 작다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]}],"answer":5,"acceptedAnswers":[5],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":151,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[30.3,25.115,60.4,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2015-meet-science2-09/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":784,"height":439,"region":0,"bbox":[11.1,74.715,313.6,175.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2015-meet-science2-09/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":771,"height":267,"region":0,"bbox":[14.7,313.515,308.4,106.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2015-meet-science2-09/03.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":6,"sourceRect":[82.9,152.885,417.0,622.222],"width":334.1,"height":469.337,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[30.3,25.115,60.4,9.6],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[11.1,74.715,313.6,175.6],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"f